{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV今天（21日）於旺角舉行2027節目巡禮，ERROR成員阿Dee何啟華除了戲劇演出，還做主持，他坦言聽取前輩意見，當今年代不要規限自己，知道公司特意從外購買版權，打造《THE CUBE》重點節目，不想錯失機會，他笑說：「我向陳啟泰方面進發，著到斯斯文文，好似好有學識，想表現成熟一面。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:01:21.840132+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:36:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T16:17:54.943550+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:41.711634+00:00","content_hash":"aeb474b45f4a12bf9e1d11862d4aa2ebe329cacf38a4d1134374bd331a5cf475","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}